{"seq":3,"slug":"stability-plasticity","title":"稳定性与可塑性权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/foundations/stability-plasticity","wordCount":1741,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"稳定性与可塑性权衡\">稳定性与可塑性权衡</h1><p>人脑有个惊人的本事：你今天学会一门新菜的做法，并不会因此忘记怎么骑自行车。神经科学家 Grossberg 在 1980 年代把这种能力背后的矛盾命名为「稳定性—可塑性困境」（stability-plasticity dilemma）——突触必须足够可塑才能编码新经验，又必须足够稳定才能保住旧记忆，而这两个要求在物理上相互拉扯。这个生物学概念几乎一字不差地搬到了深度持续学习里，成为评判一切方法的统一标尺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>稳定性指模型保持旧任务性能的能力，可塑性指模型吸收新任务知识的能力。在共享参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 上，二者直接冲突：要稳定，就得让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 少动，但少动就学不进新东西；要可塑，就得让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 自由更新，但自由更新就会改写旧知识。所有持续学习方法本质上都是在这条一维光谱上选一个工作点。</p>\n<p>可以用一个统一的损失视角来刻画。给当前任务的损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{new}}(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 加一个约束旧知识的惩罚项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，总目标写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>new</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{total}}(\\theta) = \\mathcal{L}_{\\text{new}}(\\theta) + \\lambda \\, \\Omega(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是稳定性—可塑性的旋钮。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时纯粹追新、极度可塑、灾难性遗忘；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span> 时死守旧知、极度稳定、新任务完全学不进（这种极端叫 intransigence，顽固性）。几乎每个方法的差别，就在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 的具体形式和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的取法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[稳定性-可塑性光谱] --&gt; B[λ 趋近 0&lt;br/&gt;极度可塑]&#10;    A --&gt; C[中间工作点&lt;br/&gt;方法竞争区]&#10;    A --&gt; D[λ 趋近无穷&lt;br/&gt;极度稳定]&#10;    B --&gt; E[灾难性遗忘&lt;br/&gt;旧任务崩塌]&#10;    D --&gt; F[顽固性&lt;br/&gt;新任务学不进]&#10;    C --&gt; G[正则化: 弹簧惩罚]&#10;    C --&gt; H[回放: 旧梯度信号]&#10;    C --&gt; I[参数隔离: 物理分区]\">flowchart TD\n    A[稳定性-可塑性光谱] --&gt; B[λ 趋近 0&lt;br/&gt;极度可塑]\n    A --&gt; C[中间工作点&lt;br/&gt;方法竞争区]\n    A --&gt; D[λ 趋近无穷&lt;br/&gt;极度稳定]\n    B --&gt; E[灾难性遗忘&lt;br/&gt;旧任务崩塌]\n    D --&gt; F[顽固性&lt;br/&gt;新任务学不进]\n    C --&gt; G[正则化: 弹簧惩罚]\n    C --&gt; H[回放: 旧梯度信号]\n    C --&gt; I[参数隔离: 物理分区]</pre><h2 id=\"一道光谱看懂三大方法\">一道光谱看懂三大方法</h2><p>把三大方法家族放到这条光谱上，它们其实是用不同手段实现「在追新时不丢旧」的同一目标，区别在于约束施加的位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法家族</th>\n<th>约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 施加在哪</th>\n<th>偏稳定还是偏可塑</th>\n<th>内存成本</th>\n<th>主讲文档</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正则化</td>\n<td>权重空间（罚重要权重移动）</td>\n<td>中等，靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 调</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n<td><a href=\"../methods/regularization-ewc\">EWC</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回放</td>\n<td>数据空间（混入旧样本梯度）</td>\n<td>偏可塑且抗遗忘强</td>\n<td>与缓冲区成正比</td>\n<td><a href=\"../methods/replay-rehearsal\">回放与排练</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数隔离</td>\n<td>结构空间（旧参数物理冻结）</td>\n<td>极稳定，旧任务零遗忘</td>\n<td>参数随任务增长</td>\n<td><a href=\"../methods/parameter-isolation\">参数隔离</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正则化把惩罚加在权重上，靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 在光谱上滑动；回放绕过显式惩罚，直接让旧样本的梯度参与优化，把模型拉回旧盆地（盆地概念见 <a href=\"catastrophic-forgetting\">灾难性遗忘机理</a>）；参数隔离干脆把旧任务的参数物理冻结，从结构上保证稳定性，但代价是模型容量随任务数膨胀。没有哪个工作点对所有场景最优——这正是持续学习没有银弹的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生物大脑如何破解这道难题\">生物大脑如何破解这道难题</h2><p>人脑并不在单一光谱上死磕，而是用结构分工绕开了困境，这给了算法设计很多启发。互补学习系统（Complementary Learning Systems, CLS）理论指出，海马体负责快速、可塑地编码新经验，新皮层负责缓慢、稳定地巩固长期知识；睡眠期间海马体把当天经验「回放」给新皮层，逐步把短期记忆固化为长期记忆而不冲毁旧记忆。</p>\n<p>这套机制和算法的对应关系出奇地直接：海马体的快速编码对应高可塑性的新任务学习，新皮层的缓慢巩固对应稳定的旧知识保持，而「睡眠回放」几乎就是 <a href=\"../methods/replay-rehearsal\">回放与排练</a> 方法的生物原型——这也是为什么回放被认为是最符合生物直觉、实践中也最强的方法家族。突触巩固（synaptic consolidation）则把重要突触的可塑性降低以保护已学知识，正是 EWC 的灵感来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量这个权衡\">度量这个权衡</h2><p>要在这条光谱上做工程决策，必须能量化稳定性和可塑性。稳定性常用旧任务在学完新任务后的性能保持率来度量，对应后向迁移指标；可塑性用模型在每个新任务刚到达时能达到的性能来度量。一个方法可以同时报告这两个数，画在二维平面上就得到它的「工作点」，不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 扫出一条权衡曲线（Pareto 前沿）。</p>\n<p>这套度量的严格定义、以及后向迁移与前向迁移如何分别捕捉稳定性与可塑性，是 <a href=\"../settings/evaluation-metrics\">评估指标与基准</a> 的主题。这里只需记住一个判据：评价持续学习方法，绝不能只看新任务表现，也绝不能只看旧任务保持，必须看二者构成的权衡曲线整体往哪个方向移动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"面对具体场景如何选工作点\">面对具体场景如何选工作点</h3><p>既然没有普适最优，工程上就要按场景特征挑工作点。下表把常见约束条件与相应的偏向、首选手段对应起来，是本文权衡框架的落地用法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景特征</th>\n<th>应偏向</th>\n<th>首选手段</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>任务边界清晰、任务数少</td>\n<td>可塑</td>\n<td>回放</td>\n<td>有边界可批量复习旧任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无边界、数据流式到达</td>\n<td>折中</td>\n<td>在线回放 + 漂移检测</td>\n<td>兼顾复习与适应漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端侧、算力与能耗受限</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>LoRA / 参数隔离</td>\n<td>少更新省电，旧任务零遗忘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私禁存原始样本</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>EWC 等正则化</td>\n<td>不依赖任何历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类增量、需跨任务判别</td>\n<td>可塑且抗遗忘</td>\n<td>回放</td>\n<td>只有回放能提供跨任务对比信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选工作点的顺序是先定硬约束（隐私、算力这类不可协商的），再在剩余自由度里按精度需求微调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 或缓冲区大小。硬约束一旦确定，可选的方法家族往往就只剩一两个，权衡的难度也随之收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稳定性—可塑性困境源自神经科学，指保持旧知识与吸收新知识在共享参数上天然冲突。</li>\n<li>所有方法都可统一为「新任务损失 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 倍旧知识惩罚」，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是稳定性—可塑性的旋钮，两个极端分别是灾难性遗忘与顽固性。</li>\n<li>正则化、回放、参数隔离分别在权重空间、数据空间、结构空间施加约束，没有对所有场景最优的工作点。</li>\n<li>人脑用互补学习系统（海马体快编码、新皮层慢巩固、睡眠回放）绕开困境，直接启发了回放与 EWC。</li>\n<li>工程上要用后向迁移度量稳定性、用新任务即时性能度量可塑性，看二者构成的权衡曲线整体移动方向。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Grossberg 稳定性-可塑性困境原始工作；McClelland 等互补学习系统（CLS）理论；《A Comprehensive Survey on Continual Learning in Generative Models》(arXiv:2506.13045, 2025)。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稳定性与可塑性权衡","id":"稳定性与可塑性权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一道光谱看懂三大方法","id":"一道光谱看懂三大方法"},{"level":2,"text":"生物大脑如何破解这道难题","id":"生物大脑如何破解这道难题"},{"level":2,"text":"度量这个权衡","id":"度量这个权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"面对具体场景如何选工作点","id":"面对具体场景如何选工作点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"灾难性遗忘机理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/foundations/catastrophic-forgetting"},"next":{"title":"正则化方法 EWC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/continual-lifelong-learning/methods/regularization-ewc"}}